---
kind: lore
id: mid.gates
title: The sleeping giant and the waking flute
---

// Gate sleepingGiant (Route 12) while it is shut, in mid's words (the spine's
// fallback is at -10). East's wakingFlute opens it; walking onto Route 12
// with the flute plays mid.giantWakes. Playing the flute anywhere else only
// gets these.

<entry id="midGateSleepingGiant" on="obstacle" target="gate.sleepingGiant" category="bark" when="!holds('canPass', ['sleepingGiant'])">
  @narrator{code="0010"}: A wall of fur blocks the lakeshore road from one side to the other. It rises, it falls, it snores. You push it. It snores louder.
  @narrator{code="0020"}: Hermit Ashby's voice comes from his hut: "Only music wakes it! There was a flute at Ash Tower, before the Eclipse lot came!"
</entry>

<entry id="midFluteElsewhere" on="useItem" target="item.wakingFlute" category="bark" when="!visited('mid.giantWakes')">
  @narrator{code="0010"}: You play one note on the flute. Somewhere south of Fairhaven, something enormous turns over in its sleep. Not here, though. Not yet.
</entry>

<entry id="midFluteAfter" on="useItem" target="item.wakingFlute" category="bark" when="visited('mid.giantWakes')">
  @narrator{code="0010"}: You play the flute. Every Duskbat within a mile wakes up and tells you about it.
</entry>
